1
00:06:08,000 --> 00:06:14,000
The Ritual Killer is a mystery, thriller, action film directed by George Gallo.

2
00:12:16,000 --> 00:12:22,000
Unable to process the death of his daughter, Detective Boyd embarks on a hunt for a
serial killer who murders according to a brutal tribal ritual: Muti.

3
00:18:24,000 --> 00:18:30,000
The only person who can help Boyd is Professor Mackles, an
anthropologist who hides an unspeakable secret.

4
00:24:32,000 --> 00:24:38,000
The line between sanity and madness thins as Boyd
goes deeper into the killer’s world.

5
00:30:40,000 --> 00:30:46,000
Dr. Mackles, played by Morgan Freeman.

6
00:36:48,000 --> 00:36:54,000
Detective Lucas Boyd, played by Cole Hauser.

7
00:42:56,000 --> 00:43:02,000
Randoku, played by Vernon Davis.

8
00:49:04,000 --> 00:49:10,000
Captain Marchand, played by Peter Stormare.

9
00:55:12,000 --> 00:55:18,000
Inspector Mario Lavazzi, played by Giuseppe Zeno.

10
01:01:20,000 --> 01:01:26,000
Detective Kersch, played by Murielle Hilaire.

11
01:07:28,000 --> 01:07:34,000
The Ritual Killer is a 2023 American
action-thriller film directed by George Gallo.

12
01:13:36,000 --> 01:13:42,000
It stars Morgan Freeman and Cole Hauser.

13
01:19:44,000 --> 01:19:50,000
It was released by Screen Media and Redbox Entertainment on March 10, 2023.

14
01:25:52,000 --> 01:25:58,000
The tone is dark and emotional and mind_bending.
